I thought of this last week and got so obsessed with the idea that I had to cram to finish it for this weekend😅 Literally filmed it all yesterday. Shoutout to my buddy who stuck with me all day to help record everything! Hopefully it turned out well enough to be worth the work- I think it’s beautiful 😂

