@SpongeBobOfficial  @creed

Probably one of the best weekends of my life. Got to visit Galaxy’s Edge with my best friends- had an absolute blast. And it was SO COOL to meet so many of you!!! Sure, wearing giant Lego hair on your head makes you a walking billboard, but I seriously was not expecting very many people to recognize me. 
I wasn’t really going on the trip with plans to “make content”, so this is really just a random edit of videos my friends got.

